function atlasBlit(P,c,fi,dx,dy,dw,dh,eff){const f=P.frames[fi];let L=0;while(L<2&&eff<.55/(1<<L))L++;const k=1<<L;c.drawImage(P.mips[L],f[0]/k,f[1]/k,P.cw/k,P.ch/k,dx,dy,dw,dh);}
